{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36598","headline":"清明日曲江怀友 · 罗隐","name":"清明日曲江怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君与田苏即旧游，我於交分亦绸缪。\n二年隔绝黄泉下，尽日悲凉曲水头。\n鸥鸟似能齐物理，杏花疑欲伴人愁。\n寡妻稚子应寒食，遥望江陵一泪流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}